  "description": "Mesh-map generator golden of phase3.2_proc-generator-families (calibration): the occlusion generator cases on the authored unit cube with edges and corners rounded at radius 0.1 (six UV islands), texture set 2048 px. Painter bakes the mesh maps low as high (OutputSize 11, LowAsHigh, DilationWidth 0, bakers Normal, WorldSpaceNormal, AO, Curvature, Position, Thickness, every other baking parameter at Painter's default). Each case is a white Raw fill on its own L32F User channel, over a black base fill, under a black mask holding the generator: User0 defaults: Ambient Occlusion (ao_invert = 0, global_invert = 0); User1 recipe-tunic-v10: Ambient Occlusion (ao_invert = 0, global_invert = 1); User2 boundary-ao-invert: Ambient Occlusion (ao_invert = 1, global_invert = 0); User3 boundary-both-inverts: Ambient Occlusion (ao_invert = 1, global_invert = 1). The User maps and the baked AO, WorldSpaceNormal maps are exported as OpenEXR 32f, padding passthrough, no dithering; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen). Bake backend uncontrolled.",
